a natural and immersive learning experience while maintaining awareness of the surrounding environment.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Mixed Reality-based CPR training\n\u2022 AED education and emergency response training\n\u2022 Seamless integration of virtual training content with the real environment\n\u2022 Intuitive hand-based interaction\n\u2022 Designed for schools, hospitals, emergency services, and corporate safety training\n\u2022 Repeatable training sessions that enhance learning effectiveness\n\nReaLive MR enhances conventional CPR education by providing a safe, immersive, and highly interactive training environment that helps learners develop practical life-saving skills and emergency response capabilities.\n\nDeveloped by TechSan Co., Ltd., ReaLive MR combines advanced Mixed Reality technology with immersive CPR education to deliver realistic and effective emergency response training.", "short_description": "ReaLive MR is a Mixed Reality CPR training solution that enables immersive CPR and AED education using Meta Quest devices."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ub85c\uace0_\uc228\ud130\uce58 1024_1024.png", "id": "1592341982239556", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1592341985572889_6947409751023236525_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TgDAP_NWZm0Q7kNvwHFBQFt&_nc_oc=Adq25vFwJNZQs1eg62YAHRrfYxiNlgApz9on-DB0Kds5jsPhzg1YmMomXafYD_n2kfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIzfMUdDwPfzYVOhnDlqmslb9fjT4H4-ZTDiIk5JEmdhw&oe=6A9853BF"}, {"file_name": "\uc228\ud130\uce58_\ub300\ud45c_3000x900_Safe area.png", "id": "1306835034770003", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623384_1306835038103336_6820841876092211466_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3lSaTZ0QPsUQ7kNvwFsBXDG&_nc_oc=Adrt-fXWwyA82-BywtRVXPEjpG-bA2RxKQCrfcIg-LyzYp-A5SxuQBkMzzBi4KQHZKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-